This is the format that most directly separates Infusion Play from other Victoria venues. As of May 2026, no other Downtown Victoria operator lists high-intensity physical obstacle rooms of this kind. Escape rooms and VR venues in the area don't include this category. It's a genuine gap in the local market that Infusion Play fills.

